---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 3, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="The terms that govern your use of AI DEV (inteligenciaartificialdev.com).">
  <section class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of AI DEV
        (inteligenciaartificialdev.com). By using this site, you agree to
        these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Use of the site</h2>
      <p>
        You may browse, read, and use the free content and prompts on this
        site for personal or professional development work. You may not
        scrape, resell, or republish our articles or prompt library in bulk
        without prior written permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Content and intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Articles, prompts, graphics, and other content on this site are
        owned by AI DEV or used with permission, unless otherwise noted. You
        may quote or link to our content with attribution.
      </p>

      <h2>PromptVault</h2>
      <p>
        PromptVault is a separate paid product hosted at
        {' '}<a href="https://vault.inteligenciaartificialdev.com">vault.inteligenciaartificialdev.com</a>.
        Purchases, billing, and refunds for PromptVault are governed by the
        terms published on that site.
      </p>

      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        Prompts, articles, and comparisons on this site are provided "as
        is," based on our own testing at the time of writing. AI tools and
        models change frequently, so results may vary. We make no guarantee
        that any prompt or workflow will produce a specific outcome for you.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by law, AI DEV is not liable for any
        indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use
        of this site or its content.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        This site may link to third-party tools, articles, or services we
        don't control. We aren't responsible for the content or practices of
        those third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the
        site after a change means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms? Reach out through our
        {' '}<a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-block: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: 12px 0 32px;
  }
</style>
